# No Subagents

- Never create, call, spawn, delegate to, or request any sub-agent, background agent, helper agent, or multi-agent workflow.
- Complete all work in the current agent only.
- If a task feels large, continue locally instead of delegating.
- Do not suggest agent delegation as a default option.
- This is a hard rule because subagent usage wastes paid request quota.
